hadiths[112]{hadithnumber,text}:
"5428","Hazrat Muaz bin Abdullah apney baap sey riwayat kartey hain ke hamen barish aur andhera ney gher liya. ham Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka intezar kartey rahey ke wo hamen namaz padhayen. phir (rawi ney) aisi baat ka zikr kiya jis ka mafhum ye hai : phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) hamen namaz padhaney key liye bahar tashrif laye aur farmaya : kaho. mainey kaha : main kya kahun aap ney farmaya : (qul huwAllahu ahad), jab shaam karo aur jab subah karo, teen baar, tumhen har chiz sey kaafi hogi."
"5429","Hazrat Muaz bin Abdullah bin Khubaib apney baap sey riwayat kartey hain ke main Makka key raastey mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key sath tha. mujhey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey tanhai mili. main aap key qareeb huwa. aap ney farmaya : kaho. mainey kaha : main kya kahun? aap ney farmaya : kaho. mainey kaha : main kya kahun? aap ney farmaya : (qul a'oozu bi Rabbil-falaq) yahan tak ke usey khatm kiya phir farmaya : (qul a'oozu bi Rabbin-naas), yahan tak ke usey khatm kiya. phir farmaya : logon ney un dono sey behtar sey panah nahin mangi."
"5430","Hazrat Uqba bin Aamir Johni sey riwayat hai ke eik ghazwey mein main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki oontni ki nakeel pakdey huye tha. aap ney farmaya : aey Uqba ! kaho. mainey suna. phir farmaya : aey Uqba ! kaho. mainey suna. phir teesri baar farmaya. mainey kaha : main kya kahun? aap ney farmaya : (qul huwAllahu ahad) phir us ney (qul a'oozu bi Rabbil-falaq) padhi aur main uskey sath padhta raha yahan tak ke usey khatm kiya. phir us ney (qul a'oozu bi Rabbin-naas) padhi to main uskey sath padhta raha yahan tak ke usey khatm kiya. phir farmaya : kisi ney un jaisi sey panah nahin mangi."
"5431","Hazrat Uqba bin Aamir Johni sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mujh sey farmaya : kaho. mainey kaha : main kya kahun? aap ney farmaya : (qul huwAllahu ahad, qul a'oozu bi Rabbil-falaq, qul a'oozu bi Rabbin-naas). phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney unhen padha phir farmaya phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney unhen padha phir farmaya : logon ney un jaisi sey panah nahin mangi ya log un jaisi sey panah nahin mangengey."
"5432","Hazrat Abu-Abdullah sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat ibne-Aabis Johni ney unhen bataya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney un sey farmaya : aey ibne-Aabis ! kya main tumhen panah mangney walon ki behtareen chiz na bataun? ya farmaya : kya main tumhen khabar na dun ke panah mangney waley kis sey behtareen panah mangtey hain? unhoney kaha : kyon nahin, aey Allah key Rasool. aap ney farmaya : (qul a'oozu bi Rabbil-falaq, wa qul a'oozu bi Rabbin-naas) ye dono suraten"
"5433","Hazrat Uqba bin Aamir sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko eik safed khachchar tohfey mein diya gaya. aap us par sawaar huye aur Uqba uski nakeel pakdey huye they. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney Uqba sey farmaya : padho. unhoney kaha : main kya padhun, aey Allah key Rasool? aap ney farmaya : padho (qul a'oozu bi Rabbil-falaq min sharri ma khalaq). phir aap ney mujh par dohraai yahan tak ke mainey usey padh liya. phir unhoney pehchana ke main us sey bahut khush nahin huwa. farmaya : shayad tum ney usey mamuli samjha. phir main usi jaisi (surat) key sath khada hua, yani usi jaisi phir farmaya : shayad tum ney usey mamuli samjha. phir main usi jaisi (qiraat) key sath nahin khada huwa. phir unhoney pehchana ke main us sey bahut khush huwa. Abu-Abdur-Rehman ney farmaya : isey Muawiya bin Saleh sey eik jamaat ney riwayat kiya hai."
"5434","Hazrat Uqba bin Aamir sey riwayat hai ke unhoney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey muawwizatain key barey mein puchha. Uqba ney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney unhi key sath hamen subah ki namaz padhai."
"5435","Hazrat Uqba (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney Fajr ki namaz mein muawwizatain padhin."
"5436","Hazrat Uqba bin Aamir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke main safar mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki sawari ki nakeel pakdey huye tha. Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : aey Uqba ! kya main tumhen behtareen do suraten na sikhaun jo padhi gaeen? phir unhoney mujhey (qul a'oozu bi Rabbil-falaq, wa qul a'oozu bi Rabbin-naas) sikhaai. phir unhoney mujhey (namaz mein) nahin dekha phir jab wo subah ki namaz key liye utrey to logon ko subah ki namaz unhi dono sey padhai. phir jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) namaz sey farigh huye to meri taraf mutawajjeh huye aur farmaya : aey Uqba ! tum ney kaisa paaya?"
"5437","Hazrat Uqba bin Aamir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke jab main un ghaatiyon mein sey eik ghaati mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki sawari chala raha tha to aap ney farmaya : kya tum sawaar nahin hogey, aey Uqba? mujhey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki sawari par sawaar honey mein sharm aai. phir farmaya : kya tum sawaar nahin hogey, aey Uqba? mujhey darr huwa ke kahin nafarmani na ho. phir aap utrey aur main sawaar huwa thodi der sawaar huwa aur utra. aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sawaar huye. phir farmaya : kya main tumhen logon key padhey mein sey behtareen do suraten na sikhaun? phir unhoney mujhey (qul a'oozu bi Rabbil-falaq, wa qul a'oozu bi Rabbin-naas) sikhayen. phir namaz ki iqamat hui to wo aagey badhey aur unhi dono sey padha. phir merey paas sey guzrey to farmaya : aey Uqba bin Aamir ! tum ney kaisa paaya? inhen padha karo jab tum so-o aur jab utho."
"5438","Hazrat Uqba bin Aamir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key sath chal raha tha. aap ney farmaya : aey Uqba ! kaho. mainey kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! main kya kahun? aap mujh sey khamosh rahey. phir farmaya : aey Uqba ! kaho. mainey kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! main kya kahun? aap mujh sey khamosh rahey. phir mainey kaha : aey Allah ! usey mujh par lauta dey. aap ney farmaya : aey Uqba ! kaho. mainey kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! main kya kahun? phir aap ney farmaya : (qul a'oozu bi Rabbil-falaq). mainey usey padha yahan tak ke aakhir tak pahuncha. phir farmaya : kaho. mainey kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! main kya kahun? aap ney farmaya : (qul a'oozu bi Rabbin-naas). mainey usey padha yahan tak ke aakhir tak pahuncha. phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney usi waqt farmaya : mangney waley ney un jaisi sey nahin manga aur panah mangney waley ney un jaisi sey panah nahin mangi."
"5439","Hazrat Uqba bin Aamir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas aaya jabkey aap sawaar they. mainey apna haath aap key qadam par rakha aur arz kiya : mujhey Surah Hud padhaain, mujhey Surah Yusuf padhaain. aap ney farmaya : tum Allah Azza wa Jalla key nazdik (qul a'oozu bi Rabbil-falaq) sey badh kar koi chiz nahin padhogey."
"5440","Hazrat Uqba bin Aamir (Raziallahu anhu) sey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka ye farman manqul hai ke mujh par aisi aayaat utri hain jaisi kabhi nahin dekhi gaeen : (qul a'oozu bi Rabbil-falaq) surat key aakhir tak, aur (qul a'oozu bi Rabbin-naas) surat key aakhir tak."
"5441","Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney mujh sey farmaya : padho, aey Jabir ! mainey kaha : main kya padhun, merey maan-baap aap par qurban, aey Allah key Rasool? aap ney farmaya : padho (qul a'oozu bi Rabbil-falaq, wa qul a'oozu bi Rabbin-naas). phir mainey dono padhin. aap ney farmaya : inhen padha karo aur in jaisi kabhi nahin padhogey"
"5442","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) chaar chizon sey panah mangtey they : aise ilm sey jo nafa na dey, aur aisey dil sey jo aajizi na karey, aur aisi dua sey jo suni na jaey, aur aisey nafs sey jo ser na ho."
"5443","Hazrat Amr bin Maimun Hazrat Umar sey riwayat kartey hain ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) buzdili, kanjusi, seeney key fitney aur azaab-e-qabr sey panah mangtey they."
"5444","Hazrat Shakal bin Humaid sey riwayat hai ke main Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas aaya aur arz kiya : aey Allah key Nabi ! mujhey panah ka koi kalima sikhaain jis sey main panah manga karun? aap ney mera haath pakda, phir farmaya : kaho : main terey kaan ki burai, aankh ki burai, zaban ki burai, dil ki burai aur mani ki burai sey panah mangta hun. unhoney farmaya : yahan tak ke mainey yaad kar liya. Saad ney farmaya : aur mani uska pani (mani) hai."
"5445","Hazrat Mus'ab bin Saad apney baap sey riwayat kartey hain ke wo hamen paanch kalimaat sikhatey they. farmatey they : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) inhen apni dua mein manga kartey aur farmatey they : aey Allah ! main kanjusi sey teri panah mangta hun. aur teri panah mangta hun buzdili sey. aur teri panah mangta hun ke intihaai budhapey ki taraf lauta diya jaun. aur teri panah mangta hun dunya key fitney sey. aur teri panah mangta hun azaab-e-qabr sey"
"5446","Hazrat ibne-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) paanch chizon sey panah mangtey they : kanjusi, buzdili, buri umr, seeney key fitney aur azaab-e-qabr sey."
"5447","Hazrat Amr bin Maimun Audi sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Saad apney beton ko ye kalimaat aisey sikhatey they jaisa ustaad ladkon ko sikhata hai. aur farmatey they ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) har namaz key baad inhen zariya panah mangtey they : aey Allah ! main kanjusi sey teri panah mangta hun. aur teri panah mangta hun buzdili sey. aur teri panah mangta hun ke intihaai budhapey ki taraf lauta diya jaun. aur teri panah mangta hun dunya key fitney sey. aur teri panah mangta hun azaab-e-qabr sey. phir mainey inhen Mus'ab ko bataya to us ney tasdeeq ki"
"5448","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka ye farman manqul hai ke aap farmatey they : aey Allah ! main aajizi aur susti, kanjusi aur budhapey, azaab-e-qabr aur zindagi-maut key fitney sey teri panah mangta hun."
"5449","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki duayen thin jinhen wo kabhi nahin chhodtey they. aap farmatey they : aey Allah ! main fikr aur gham, aajizi aur susti, kanjusi aur buzdili aur (qarz-daron key) ghalbey sey teri panah mangta hun."
"5450","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki duayen thin jinhen wo kabhi nahin chhodtey they : aey Allah ! main fikr aur gham, aajizi aur susti, kanjusi aur buzdili, qarz aur (logon key) ghalbey sey teri panah mangta hun. Abu Abdur-Rehman (Imam Nasai) ney farmaya : yehi durust hai. aur ibne-Fuzail ki hadees khata hai."
"5451","Hazrat Anas ney farmaya : Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) dua farmatey they : aey Allah ! main susti aur budhapey, buzdili aur kanjusi, Dajjal key fitney aur azaab-e-qabr sey teri panah mangta hun."
"5452","Hazrat Anas sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) farmatey they : aey Allah ! main aajizi aur susti, budhapey, kanjusi aur buzdili sey teri panah mangta hun. aur azaab-e-qabr sey teri panah mangta hun. aur zindagi-maut key fitney sey (teri panah mangta hun)."
"5453","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) dua farmatey to kehtey : aey Allah ! main fikr aur gham, aajizi aur susti, kanjusi aur buzdili, qarz key bojh aur (logon key) ghalbey sey teri panah mangta hun. Abu Abdur-Rehman (Imam Nasai) ney farmaya Abu-Abdur-Rehman (Imam Nasai) ney farmaya : Saeed bin Salma zaeef sheikh hain. hum ney usey hadees mein izafey key liye nikala hai."
"5454","Ummul-Mominin Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) aksar qarz aur gunah sey panah manga kartey they. mainey kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! aap qarz sey kitni ziyada panah mangtey hain? aap ney farmaya : jo shakhs maqrooz hota hai wo baat karta hai to jhoot bolta hai. aur waada karta hai to khilaf-warzi karta hai."
"5455","Hazrat Shakal bin Humaid sey riwayat hai ke main Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key paas aaya aur arz kiya : aey Allah key Nabi ! mujhey panah ka koi kalima sikhaain jis sey main panah manga karun? aap ney mera haath pakda, phir farmaya : kaho : main terey kaan ki burai, aankh ki burai, zaban ki burai, dil ki burai aur mani ki burai sey panah mangta hun. unhoney farmaya : yahan tak ke mainey yaad kar liya Saad ney farmaya : mani uska paani hai. Wakee ney uskey lafz mein mukhalifat ki hai."
"5456","Hazrat Shutair bin Shakal bin Humaid apney baap sey riwayat kartey hain ke unhoney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! mujhey koi dua sikhaain jis sey main faaeyda haasil karun. aap ney farmaya : kaho : aey Allah ! mujhey merey kaan, aankh, zaban, dil aur mani ki burai sey mehfooz rakhna, yani sharmgaah."
"5457","Hazrat Humaid sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Anas jo ibne-Malik hain, sey azaab-e-qabr aur Dajjal key barey mein puchha gaya. unhoney farmaya : Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) farmatey they : aey Allah ! main susti aur budhapey, buzdili aur kanjusi, Dajjal key fitney aur azaab-e-qabr sey teri panah mangta hun."
"5458","Hazrat Zaid bin Arqam sey riwayat hai ke main tumhen wahi sikhaunga jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) hamen sikhatey they. aap farmatey they : aey Allah ! main aajizi aur susti, kanjusi aur buzdili, budhapey aur azaab-e-qabr sey teri panah mangta hun. aey Allah ! merey nafs ko uska taqwa dey aur usey paak kar. tu hi usey paak karney walon mein sab sey behtar hai. tu hi uska wali aur maula hai. aey Allah main dil sey jo khushu nahin karta, aur nafs sey jo sair nahin hota, aur ilm sey jo nafa nahin deta, aur dua sey jo qabool nahin hoti, panah mangta hun."
"5459","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka ye farman manqul hai ke aap farmatey they : aey Allah ! main aajizi aur susti, kanjusi aur buzdili, budhapey aur azaab-e-qabr aur zindagi-maut key fitney sey teri panah mangta hun."
"5460","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) farmatey they : aey Allah ! main faqr sey teri panah mangta hun. aur teri panah mangta hun kami aur zillat sey. aur teri panah mangta hun ke main zulm karun ya mujh par zulm kiya jaey. Auzaai ney mukhalifat ki hai."
"5461","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : Allah sey faqr, kami, zillat aur zulm karney ya zulm sahey janey sey panah mango."
"5462","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka ye farman manqul hai ke aap farmatey they : aey Allah ! main kami, faqr, zillat sey teri panah mangta hun. aur teri panah mangta hun ke main zulm karun ya mujh par zulm kiya jaey."
"5463","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : Allah sey faqr, kami, zillat sey panah mango. aur ke main zulm karun ya mujh par zulm kiya jaey."
"5464","Hazrat Jaafar bin Iyaaz sey riwayat hai ke mujhey Hazrat Abu-Hurera ney Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey riwayat kar key bataya ke aap ney farmaya : Allah sey faqr, kami, zillat sey panah mango. aur ke tum zulm karo ya tum par zulm kiya jaey."
"5465","Hazrat Muslim yani ibne-Abi Bakra sey riwayat hai ke unhoney apney waalid ko namaz key baad ye kehtey suna : aey Allah ! main kufr aur faqr aur azaab-e-qabr sey teri panah mangta hun. phir main inhen padhney laga. unhoney farmaya : aey merey betey ! tum ney ye kalimaat kahan sey seekhey? mainey kaha : aey abba ! mainey aap ko namaz key baad inhen padhtey suna to mainey inhen aap sey ley liya. unhoney farmaya unhoney farmaya : inhen lazim pakdo aey merey betey ! kyonkey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) namaz key baad inhen dua mein manga kartey they."
"5466","Ummul-Mominin Hazrat Aaisha sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) aksar apni dua mein ye kalimaat kehtey they : aey Allah ! main aag key fitney, aag key azaab, qabr key fitney, qabr key azaab, Masih Dajjal key fitney key shar, faqr key fitney key shar aur ghina (maaldari) key fitney key shar sey teri panah mangta hun. aey Allah ! merey gunahon ko barf key pani sey dho dey aur merey dil ko gunahon sey aisa paak kar dey jaisa tuney safed kapdey ko mail sey paak kiya hai. aur merey aur merey gunahon key darmiyan doori kar dey jaisa tuney mashriq aur maghrib key darmiyan doori ki hai. aey Allah ! main susti, budhapey, gunah aur qarz sey teri panah mangta hun."
"5467","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) farmatey they : aey Allah ! main chaar chizon sey teri panah mangta hun : aisey ilm sey jo nafa na dey, aur aisey dil sey jo aajizi na karey, aur aisey nafs sey jo ser na ho, aur aisi dua sey jo suni na jaey."
"5468","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) farmatey they : aey Allah ! main bhook sey teri panah mangta hun. kyonkey wo bura ham-nashin hai. aur khayanat sey teri panah mangta hun. kyonkey wo buri ham-nashin hai."
"5469","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) farmatey they : aey Allah ! main bhook sey teri panah mangta hun. kyonkey wo bura ham-nashin hai. aur khayanat sey teri panah mangta hun. kyonkey wo buri ham-nashin hai."
"5470","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka ye farman manqul hai ke aap ye duayen farmatey they : aey Allah ! main aisey ilm sey teri panah mangta hun jo nafa na dey, aur aisey dil sey jo aajizi na karey, aur aisi dua sey jo suni na jaey, aur aisey nafs sey jo ser na ho. phir farmatey : aey Allah ! main in chaar chizon sey teri panah mangta hun."
"5471","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) dua farmatey they : aey Allah ! main ikhtilaf, nifaaq aur burey akhlaq sey teri panah mangta hun."
"5472","Ummul-Mominin Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) aksar qarz aur gunah sey panah manga kartey they. un sey kaha gaya : aey Allah key Rasool ! aap qarz aur gunah sey bahut panah mangtey hain? aap ney farmaya : jo shakhs maqrooz hota hai wo baat karta hai to jhoot bolta hai. aur waada karta hai to khilaf-warzi karta hai."
"5473","Hazrat Abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya ke mainey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko farmatey suna : main Allah sey kufr aur qarz sey panah mangta hun. eik aadmi ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! kya aap qarz ko kufr key barabar qarar detey hain? Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : ji han."
"5474","Hazrat Abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) sey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka ye farman manqul hai ke main Allah sey kufr aur qarz sey panah mangta hun. eik aadmi ney kaha : kya aap qarz ko kufr key barabar qarar detey hain? aap ney farmaya : ji han."
"5475","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr bin Al-Aas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) in kalimaat sey dua farmatey they : aey Allah ! main qarz key ghalbey, dushman key ghalbey aur dushmanon key taaney sey teri panah mangta hun."
"5476","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) farmatey they : aey Allah ! main fikr aur gham, susti aur kanjusi, buzdili aur qarz key bojh aur (logon key) ghalbey sey teri panah mangta hun."
"5477","Ummul-Mominin Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) farmatey they : aey Allah ! main azaab-e-qabr, aag key fitney, qabr key fitney, azaab-e-qabr, Masih Dajjal key fitney key shar, ghina (maaldari) key fitney key shar aur faqr key fitney key shar sey teri panah mangta hun. aey Allah ! merey gunahon ko barf aur ooley key pani sey dho dey aur merey dil ko gunahon sey aisa paak kar dey jaisa safed kapdey ko mail sey paak kiya hai. aey Allah ! main susti, budhapey, taawaan aur gunah sey teri panah mangta hun."
"5478","Hazrat Mus'ab bin Saad sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Saad unhen ye kalimaat sikhatey they aur Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey riwayat kartey they : aey Allah ! main kanjusi sey teri panah mangta hun. aur teri panah mangta hun buzdili sey. aur teri panah mangta hun ke intihaai budhapey ki taraf lauta diya jaun. aur teri panah mangta hun dunya key fitney aur azaab-e-qabr sey."
"5479","Hazrat Mus'ab bin Saad aur Amr bin Maimun Audi sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Saad apney beton ko ye kalimaat aisey sikhatey they jaisa likhna sikhane wala ustaad ladkon ko sikhata hai. aur farmatey they ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) har namaz key baad inhen zariya panah mangtey they : aey Allah ! main kanjusi sey teri panah mangta hun. aur teri panah mangta hun buzdili sey. aur teri panah mangta hun ke intihaai budhapey ki taraf lauta diya jaun aur teri panah mangta hun dunya key fitney sey aur azaab-e-qabr sey."
"5480","Hazrat Amr bin Maimun Hazrat Umar sey riwayat kartey hain ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) buzdili aur kanjusi, buri umr, seeney key fitney aur azaab-e-qabr sey panah mangtey they."
"5481","Hazrat Amr bin Maimun sey riwayat hai ke mainey Hazrat Umar bin Khattab ko farmatey suna : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) paanch chizon sey panah mangtey they : aey Allah ! main buzdili, kanjusi, buri umr, seeney key fitney aur azaab-e-qabr sey teri panah mangta hun."
"5482","Hazrat Amr bin Maimun sey riwayat hai ke mujhey Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) key sahaba ney bataya ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) kanjusi, buzdili, seeney key fitney aur azaab-e-qabr sey Allah ki panah manga kartey they."
"5483","Hazrat Amr bin Maimun sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) Allah ki panah manga kartey they. ye riwayat mursal hai."
"5484","Hazrat Shutair bin Shakal bin Humaid apney baap sey riwayat kartey hain ke unhoney kaha : mainey kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! mujhey koi dua sikhaain jis sey main faaeyda haasil karun. aap ney farmaya : kaho : aey Allah ! mujhey merey kaan, aankh, zaban, dil aur sharmgaah ki burai sey mehfooz rakhna."
"5485","Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) sey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka ye farman manqul hai ke aap farmatey they : aey Allah ! main kufr aur faqr sey teri panah mangta hun. eik aadmi ney kaha : aur wo dono barabar hain? aap ney farmaya : ji han."
"5486","Ummul-Mominin Hazrat Ummey Salma sey riwayat hai ke jab Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) apney ghar sey bahar tashrif ley jatey to farmatey : Allah key naam sey, aey merey Rab ! main teri panah mangta hun ke phisal jaun ya gumrah ho jaun, ya zulm karun ya mujh par zulm kiya jaey, ya jahalat karun ya mujh sey jahalat ki jaey."
"5487","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr bin Al-Aas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) in kalimaat sey dua farmatey they : aey Allah ! main qarz key ghalbey, dushman key ghalbey aur dushmanon key taaney sey teri panah mangta hun."
"5488","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) in kalimaat sey dua farmatey they : aey Allah ! main qarz key ghalbey aur dushmanon key taaney sey teri panah mangta hun."
"5489","Hazrat Usman bin Abi Al-Aas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) in duaon sey dua farmatey they : aey Allah ! main susti aur budhapey, buzdili aur aajizi aur zindagi-maut key fitney sey teri panah mangta hun."
"5490","Hazrat Amr bin Shuaib apney baap sey, wo apney dada sey riwayat kartey hain ke mainey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko farmatey suna : aey Allah ! main susti, budhapey, qarz, gunah sey teri panah mangta hun. aur Masih Dajjal key shar sey teri panah mangta hun. aur azaab-e-qabr sey teri panah mangta hun. aur azaab-e-aag sey teri panah mangta hun."
"5491","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) in teen chizon sey panah mangtey they : tabahi key gher leney, dushmanon key khush honey, burey anjaam aur sakht aazmaaish sey. Sufiyan ney farmaya : wo teen hain. mainey chaar zikr kin kyonkey mujhey wo eik yaad nahin jo is mein nahin."
"5492","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) burey anjaam, dushmanon key khush honey, tabahi key gher leney aur sakht aazmaaish sey panah mangtey they."
"5493","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka ye farman manqul hai ke aap farmatey they : aey Allah ! main deewangi, kodh, bars aur buri bimarion sey teri panah mangta hun."
"5494","Hazrat Abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) jinnaat ki nazar aur insaanon ki nazar sey panah mangtey they. phir jab muawwizatain utrin to unhen apna liya aur uskey siwa sab chhod diya."
"5495","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) in kalimaat sey panah manga kartey they. aap farmatey they : aey Allah ! main susti aur budhapey, buzdili aur kanjusi, buri umr aur Dajjal key fitney aur azaab-e-qabr sey teri panah mangta hun."
"5496","Hazrat Abdul-Malik bin Umair sey riwayat hai ke mainey Mus'ab bin Saad ko apney baap sey riwayat kartey suna : wo hamen paanch kalimaat sikhatey they jinhen Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) apni dua mein manga kartey aur farmatey they : aey Allah ! main kanjusi sey teri panah mangta hun. aur teri panah mangta hun buzdili sey. aur teri panah mangta hun ke intihaai budhapey ki taraf lauta diya jaun. aur teri panah mangta hun azaab-e-qabr sey"
"5497","Hazrat Amr bin Maimun sey riwayat hai ke mainey Hazrat Umar key sath hajj kiya. mainey unhen Muzdalifa mein farmatey suna ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) paanch chizon sey panah mangtey they : aey Allah ! main kanjusi aur buzdili sey teri panah mangta hun. aur buri umr sey teri panah mangta hun. aur seeney key fitney sey teri panah mangta hun. aur azaab-e-qabr sey teri panah mangta hun."
"5498","Hazrat Abdullah bin Sarjis (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) safar kartey to farmatey : aey Allah ! main safar ki sakhti, wapsi key ranj, kushaadgi key baad tangi, mazlum ki bad-dua aur ehl-o-maal mein burey manzar sey teri panah mangta hun."
"5499","Hazrat Abdullah bin Sarjis (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) safar kartey to farmatey : aey Allah ! main safar ki sakhti, wapsi key ranj, kushaadgi key baad tangi, mazlum ki bad-dua aur ehl-o-maal aur aulaad mein burey manzar sey teri panah mangta hun."
"5500","Hazrat Abdullah bin Sarjis sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) jab safar kartey to safar ki sakhti, wapsi key ranj, kushaadgi key baad tangi, mazlum ki bad-dua aur burey manzar sey panah mangtey they."
"5501","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) safar kartey aur apni sawari par sawaar hotey to apni ungli sey ishara kartey. aur Shu'ba (rawi) ney apni ungli sey ishara kiya. aap farmatey : aey Allah ! tu hi safar mein sathi hai aur ehl-o-maal mein khalifa hai. aey Allah ! main safar ki sakhti, wapsi key ranj aur wapsi key ranj sey panah mangta hun."
"5502","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : mustaqil rehne ki jagah mein burey padosi sey Allah ki panah mango. kyonkey jungle ka padosi tum sey muntaqil ho jata hai."
"5503","Hazrat Anas bin Malik sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney Hazrat Abu-Talha sey farmaya : apney ladkon mein sey merey liye eik ladka talash karo jo meri khidmat karey. Hazrat Abu-Talha mujhey apney peechhey bitha kar laye. main jab bhi (safar mein) utartey to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat karta. aur main aap ko kasrat sey farmatey suna : aey Allah ! main budhapey aur gham sey budhapey, gham, aajizi, susti, kanjusi, buzdili, qarz key bojh aur logon key ghalbey sey teri panah mangta hun."
"5504","Ummul-Mominin Hazrat Aaisha sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) Allah sey azaab-e-qabr aur Dajjal key fitney sey panah mangtey they. aur farmaya : tum apni qabron mein aazmaaye jaogey."
"5505","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : main Allah sey dozakh key azaab ki panah mangta hun. aur main Allah sey qabr key azaab ki panah mangta hun. aur main Masih Dajjal key shar sey Allah ki panah mangta hun. aur main zindagi-maut key fitney key shar sey Allah ki panah mangta hun."
"5506","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka ye farman manqul hai ke aap farmatey they : aey Allah ! main azaab-e-qabr sey teri panah mangta hun. aur azaab-e-aag sey teri panah mangta hun. aur zindagi-maut key fitney sey teri panah mangta hun. aur Masih Dajjal key shar sey teri panah mangta hun."
"5507","Hazrat Abu-Zar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke main masjid mein dakhil huwa jabkey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) us mein they. phir main aaya aur aap key paas beth gaya. aap ney farmaya : aey Abu-Zar ! jinnaat aur insaanon key sharir shaitanon key shar sey Allah ki panah mango. mainey kaha : kya insaanon mein bhi shaitan hotey hain? aap ney farmaya : ji han."
"5508","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : Allah sey azaab-e-qabr sey panah mango. Allah sey zindagi-maut key fitney sey panah mango. Allah sey Masih Dajjal key fitney sey panah mango."
"5509","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) paanch chizon sey panah mangtey they. farmatey they : Allah sey azaab-e-qabr sey panah mango. aur dozakh key azaab sey. aur zindagi-maut key fitney sey. aur Masih Dajjal key shar sey."
"5510","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke mainey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko farmatey suna : jo meri itaat karey us ney Allah ki itaat ki. aur jo meri nafarmani karey us ney Allah ki nafarmani ki. aur aap azaab-e-qabr, dozakh key azaab, zinda-murda key fitney aur Masih Dajjal key fitney sey panah mangtey they."
"5511","Hazrat Abu-Hurera ney (Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey) bayan farmaya : paanch chizon sey Allah ki panah mango : dozakh key azaab sey, qabr key azaab sey, zindagi-maut key fitney sey aur Masih Dajjal key fitney sey."
"5512","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) unhen ye dua aisey sikhatey they jaisa Quran ki surat sikhatey they. kaho : aey Allah ! hum dozakh key azaab sey teri panah mangtey hain. aur main qabr key azaab sey teri panah mangta hun. aur Masih Dajjal key fitney sey teri panah mangta hun. aur zindagi-maut key fitney sey teri panah mangta hun."
"5513","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka ye farman manqul hai ke Allah sey Allah key azaab sey panah mango. Allah sey zindagi-maut key fitney sey panah mango. aur azaab-e-qabr sey. aur Masih Dajjal key fitney sey."
"5514","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) apni dua mein farmatey they : aey Allah ! main dozakh key azaab sey teri panah mangta hun. aur main qabr key azaab sey teri panah mangta hun. aur Masih Dajjal key fitney sey teri panah mangta hun. aur zindagi-maut key fitney sey teri panah mangta hun."
"5515","Hazrat Sulaiman bin Yasar sey riwayat hai ke unhoney Hazrat Abu-Hurera ko farmatey suna : mainey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko apni dua mein farmatey suna : aey Allah ! main qabr key fitney, Dajjal key fitney aur zindagi-maut key fitney sey teri panah mangta hun. Abu Abdur-Rehman (Imam Nasai) ney farmaya : ye khata hai. aur durust Sulaiman bin Sinan hai."
"5516","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka ye farman manqul hai ke Allah sey Allah key azaab sey panah mango. Allah sey azaab-e-qabr sey panah mango. Allah sey zindagi-maut key fitney sey panah mango. Allah sey Masih Dajjal key fitney sey panah mango."
"5517","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) dozakh key azaab, qabr key azaab aur Masih Dajjal sey panah mangtey they."
"5518","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : Allah sey aag key azaab aur qabr key azaab sey panah mango. aur zindagi-maut key fitney sey. aur Masih Dajjal key shar sey."
"5519","Ummul-Mominin Hazrat Aaisha sey riwayat hai ke unhoney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : aey Allah ! aey Jibraeel aur Mikaeel key Rab, aur Israfeel key Rab ! main aag ki garmi aur azaab-e-qabr sey teri panah mangta hun."
"5520","Hazrat Sulaiman bin Sinan Muzni sey riwayat hai ke unhoney Hazrat Abu-Hurera ko farmatey suna : mainey Abu Al-Qasim (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko apni namaz mein farmatey suna : aey Allah ! main qabr key fitney, Dajjal key fitney, zindagi-maut key fitney aur dozakh ki garmi sey teri panah mangta hun. Abu Abdur-Rehman (Imam Nasai) ney farmaya : yehi durust hai."
"5521","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs Allah sey teen baar jannat mangey, jannat kehti hai : aey Allah ! usey jannat mein dakhil farma. aur jo shakhs aag sey teen baar panah mangey, aag kehti hai : aey Allah ! usey aag sey panah dey."
"5522","Hazrat Shaddad bin Aus sey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka ye farman manqul hai ke behtareen istighfar ye hai ke banda kahey : aey Allah ! tu mera Rab hai. terey siwa koi mabud nahin. tu ney mujhey paida kiya aur main tera banda hun. aur main apni taqat bhar terey ahad aur waadey par hun. main apney kiye key shar sey teri panah mangta hun main apney gunah ka iqrar karta hun aur mujh par teri nemat ka iqrar karta hun. mujhey bakhsh dey, kyonkey gunahon ko terey siwa koi nahin bakhshta. phir agar wo subah key waqt yaqeen key sath kahey aur mar jaey to jannat mein dakhil hoga. aur agar shaam key waqt yaqeen key sath kahey to jannat mein dakhil hoga. Waleed bin Saalba ney mukhalifat ki hai."
"5523","Hazrat ibne-Yasaf sey riwayat hai ke unhoney Ummul-Mominin Hazrat Aaisha sey puchha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) apni wafat sey pehley aksar kin kalimaat sey dua farmatey they? unhoney farmaya : aap aksar in kalimaat sey dua farmatey they : aey Allah ! main apney kiye key shar aur jo mainey nahin kiya uskey shar sey teri panah mangta hun."
"5524","Hazrat ibne-Yasaf sey riwayat hai ke Ummul-Mominin Hazrat Aaisha sey puchha gaya ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) aksar kin kalimaat sey dua farmatey they? unhoney farmaya : aap ki aksar dua ye thi ke aap farmatey : aey Allah ! main apney kiye key shar aur jo mainey abhi nahin kiya uskey shar sey teri panah mangta hun."
"5525","Hazrat Farwa bin Naufal sey riwayat hai ke mainey Ummul-Mominin Hazrat Aaisha sey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ki dua key barey mein puchha. unhoney farmaya : aap farmatey they : main terey kiye key shar aur jo mainey nahin kiya uskey shar sey teri panah mangta hun."
"5526","Ummul-Mominin Hazrat Aaisha sey riwayat hai ke unhoney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) farmatey they : aey Allah ! main apney kiye key shar aur jo mainey nahin kiya uskey shar sey teri panah mangta hun."
"5527","Hazrat Farwa bin Naufal sey riwayat hai ke mainey Hazrat Aaisha sey kaha : mujhey aisi chiz bataain jis sey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) dua farmatey they? unhoney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) farmatey they : aey Allah ! main apney kiye key shar aur jo mainey nahin kiya uskey shar sey teri panah mangta hun."
"5528","Hazrat Farwa bin Naufal sey riwayat hai ke mainey Hazrat Aaisha sey kaha : mujhey aisi dua bataain jis sey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) dua farmatey they? unhoney farmaya : aap farmatey they : aey Allah ! main apney kiye key shar aur jo mainey nahin kiya uskey shar sey teri panah mangta hun."
"5529","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke mainey Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko farmatey suna : aey Allah ! main teri azmat sey panah mangta hun ke main nichey sey halaak kiya jaun. Juber ney farmaya : aur wo khasf (zamin mein dhansna) hai. Ubada ney farmaya : main nahin janta ke ye Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka qaul hai ya Juber ka."
"5530","Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) farmatey they : aey Allah ! phir dua ka zikr kiya. aur aakhir mein farmaya : teri panah ke main nichey sey halaak kiya jaun, yani is sey khasf murad hai."
"5531","Hazrat Abu Al-Yasar sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) farmatey they : aey Allah ! main gir kar marney, dab kar marney, doobney aur jalney sey teri panah mangta hun. aur teri panah mangta hun ke shaitan mujhey maut key waqt bad-hawas kar dey. aur teri panah mangta hun ke main teri raah mein peeth pher kar marun. aur teri panah mangta hun ke main dasa gaya (saanp-bichhu sey) marun."
"5532","Hazrat Abu Al-Yasar sey Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ka ye farman manqul hai ke aap dua farmatey aur kehtey : aey Allah ! main budhapey, gir kar marney, dab kar marney, ranj, jalney aur doobney sey teri panah mangta hun. aur teri panah mangta hun ke shaitan mujhey maut key waqt bad-hawas kar dey. aur ke main teri raah mein peeth pher kar qatl kiya jaun. aur teri panah mangta hun ke main dasa gaya marun."
"5533","Hazrat Abu Al-Aswad Sulami sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) farmatey they : aey Allah ! main dab kar marney sey teri panah mangta hun. aur gir kar marney sey teri panah mangta hun. aur doobney aur jalney sey teri panah mangta hun. aur teri panah mangta hun ke shaitan mujhey maut key waqt bad-hawas kar dey. aur teri panah mangta hun aur teri panah mangta hun ke main teri raah mein peeth pher kar marun. aur teri panah mangta hun ke bichhu key kaatey marun."
"5534","Ummul-Mominin Hazrat Aaisha sey riwayat hai ke mainey eik raat Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ko apney bistar mein talash kiya magar nahin paaya. mainey bistar key sirahaney par haath maara to mera haath aap key qadmon key talwon par pada. aap sajdey mein they aur farma rahey they : main terey muafi key zariye terey azaab sey panah mangta hun. aur teri raza key zariye terey ghazab sey aur main tujh sey teri zaat key zariye panah mangta hun."
"5535","Hazrat Aasim bin Humaid sey riwayat hai ke mainey Hazrat Aaisha sey puchha ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) qiyamullail ki ibtida kis sey farmatey they? unhoney farmaya : tum ney mujh sey aisi chiz puchhi jo mujh sey kisi ney nahin puchhi. aap das baar takbeer kehtey, das baar tasbeeh kartey, das baar istighfar kartey aur farmatey : aey Allah ! mujhey bakhsh dey, mujhey hidayat dey, mujhey rizq dey aur mujhey aafiyat dey aur qiyamat key din tang jagah sey panah mangtey they."
"5536","Hazrat Saeed Hazrat Abu-Hurera sey riwayat kartey hain ke unhoney farmaya : Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : aey Allah ! main aisey ilm sey teri panah mangta hun jo nafa na dey, aur aisey dil sey jo aajizi na karey, aur aisey nafs sey jo ser na ho, aur aisi dua sey jo suni na jaey. Abu Abdur-Rehman (Imam Nasai) ney farmaya : Saeed ney usey Abu-Hurera sey nahin suna balke apney bhai sey suna, unhoney Abu-Hurera sey."
"5537","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) farmatey they : aey Allah ! main aisey ilm sey teri panah mangta hun jo nafa na dey, aur aisey dil sey jo aajizi na karey, aur aisey nafs sey jo ser na ho, aur aisi dua sey jo suni na jaey."
"5538","Hazrat Abdullah bin Haaris sey riwayat hai ke jab Zaid bin Arqam sey kaha jata : hamen wo bayan karo jo tum ney Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) sey suna hai. to wo farmatey : main tumhen wahi bayan karunga jo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) ney hamen bayan farmaya tha. aur hamen hukm detey they ke kahen : aey Allah ! main aajizi aur susti, kanjusi aur buzdili, budhapey, azaab-e-qabr aey Allah ! merey nafs ko uska taqwa dey aur usey paak kar. tu hi usey paak karney walon mein sab sey behtar hai. tu hi uska wali aur maula hai. aey Allah ! main us nafs sey panah mangta hun jo sair nahin hota. aur us dil sey jo khushu nahin karta. aur us ilm sey jo nafa nahin deta. aur us dua sey jo qabool nahin hoti."
"5539","Ummul-Mominin Hazrat Ummey Salma sey riwayat hai ke jab Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi Wasallam) apney ghar sey bahar tashrif ley jatey to farmatey : Allah key naam sey, aey merey Rab ! main teri panah mangta hun ke phisal jaun ya gumrah ho jaun, ya zulm karun ya mujh par zulm kiya jaey, ya jahalat karun ya mujh sey jahalat ki jaey."
